      "filename": "Mariposa and Mormon Bar, California (21546856106).jpg",
      "title": "File:Mariposa and Mormon Bar, California (21546856106).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/Mariposa_and_Mormon_Bar%2C_California_%2821546856106%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
